Derived from Herdr's shipped mods (Herdr, Apache-2.0; the app's LICENSE is copied as
mods/*/LICENSE where a mod derives from one; before v0.5.0 the folders were named spaces-agents,
sidebar-chrome, md-menu, auto-tabs, new-menu-tui, mod-manager and automations, in this order):
  mods/am-sidebar       from Herdr's `spaces` 0.1.7 — modified throughout; see its own NOTICE,
                        LICENSE-automagik and LICENSE-herdr (the bot view, characters, form,
                        Start/Attach, briefing and the space icon dialog are this pack's). Its layout is the root
                        herdr-layout/automagik.json, so Herdr does not dock a second sidebar.
  mods/am-footer        from Herdr's `workspace-chrome` 0.1.11 — changed: main.js, mod.json; added: puzzle.svg, bot.svg and layers.svg (Lucide, ISC; bot.svg as Herdr ships it in frame/welcome)
  mods/am-status        from Herdr's `workspace-status` 0.1.12 — changed: main.js, mod.json; added: label.js,
                        RECIPE.md; monitor.svg, server.svg and branch.svg copied unchanged from
                        `workspace-chrome` as Herdr 0.1.12 ships it (am-footer's 0.1.11 is
                        older than these files)
  mods/am-markdown      from Herdr's `menu` 0.1.10, with the Markdown renderer merged in from
                        ohneda/herdr-markdown-browser (MIT; notice below) — changed: main.js,
                        mod.json; added: marks.js, open.js, LICENSE-upstream
  mods/am-tabs          from Herdr's shipped `tabs` (the app's copy, 2026-11-01) — changed: main.js,
                        mod.json; added: names.js
  mods/am-new-menu      from Herdr's `new-menu` 0.1.7 — changed: main.js, mod.json; added: target.js,
                        agents.js

Vendored from other people's repositories (each ships under Apache-2.0 as a derived work; the
upstream MIT copyright and permission notice are verbatim in mods/<mod>/LICENSE-upstream and
repeated here, as MIT requires — that file, not the mod's Apache LICENSE, is the upstream one):
  mods/am-mods          from jacksonpires/herdr-app-mod-manager — changed: main.js, core.js,
                        mod.json; added: RECIPE.md
  mods/am-automations   from DnzzL/herdr-automations — changed: main.js (fork header; agent list
                        in agents.js), mod.json (title "Automagik Automations"); added: RECIPE.md,
                        agents.js (retired agents hidden). Code otherwise upstream.
  mods/pocket-link/chat Pocket Link's live chat projection (RFC 0015), ported from stablyai/orca at
                        e1dfc022 (TypeScript to JavaScript, behaviour unchanged except as noted in
                        chat/UPSTREAM.md): decode-claude.js, decode-codex.js, decode-omp.js,
                        decode-shared.js, types.js, and the paste framing in paste.js, with their
                        tests. chat/UPSTREAM.md lists each upstream path and blob id. Pocket Link
                        is Pocket's and never part of the pack.

