mods/am-quota is this pack's own code, written against CLIProxyAPI's management API. The idea — a
panel that reads each account's quota and switches the local credential — comes from
0xRowdy/herdr-cliproxy, which publishes no licence: nothing of it is vendored, copied or
redistributed here, and no non-trivial line of it is reused (measured by line-diff). Credit for the
idea, not the code. Ask upstream for a licence before any reuse.

Emoji data in mods/am-sidebar/emoji-data.js (the space icon dialog) is generated from Unicode's character database
(Python's `unicodedata`), not copied from any font or table.
